<urn:atm:triage:resolution/AY13-QA-008/1>
  a triage:Resolution ;
  triage:resolvedBy "cipher" ;
  triage:resolvedAt "2026-09-07T17:26:47Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:fixCommit "c0afd678d" ;
  triage:fixBranch "feature/ay13-doctor-team-scope" ;
  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1300-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr independently confirmed via git show c0afd678d: DoctorReport gained a #[serde(skip)] resolved_team_scope: DoctorTeamScope field (wire-stable team_scope: String field kept unchanged), populated by atm-core's build_doctor_report. DoctorTeamScope::is_all_teams() was widened from pub(super) to pub. doctor_projection.rs now consumes report.resolved_team_scope.clone() and calls scope.is_all_teams() instead of re-deriving `!report.team_rosters.is_empty()` from raw data shape -- closing the implicit-invariant gap. Personally-run cargo test -p agent-team-mail-core -p atm-runtime green at branch head cb13ca7e38 / current PR head 8ae936a37. Closing on this evidence." .
